#: ../../../frameworks/libopencm3.rst:35
msgid ""
"The STM32 family of 32-bit Flash MCUs based on the ARM Cortex-M processor is "
"designed to offer new degrees of freedom to MCU users. It offers a 32-bit "
"product range that combines very high performance, real-time capabilities, "
"digital signal processing, and low-power, low-voltage operation, while "
"maintaining full integration and ease of development."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../frameworks/libopencm3.rst:37 ../../../frameworks/libopencm3.rst:643
